# Extracted Minecraft textures (HUD sprites, hotbar, bitmap font, block textures).
# Not redistributable under Mojang's EULA, so they stay local-only.
# See CLAUDE.md "Required local assets" for what to drop in and where.
app/src/main/assets/minecraft/

# The client jar hud_sim.py reads its textures out of. tools/README.md tells you
# to `adb pull` it to exactly this path, so it lands in the working tree by
# following the instructions -- and it's ~30MB of Mojang assets, in a public repo.
tools/*.jar
